.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class CELL> bool \fBcsmp::ModelSubDomain\fP< dim, CELL >::CopyGradientOfProperty_A_To_B (const char * a, const char * b)"
Provided that property 'a' is a scalar node variable and property 'b' is a \fBvector<double>\fP variable placed on the cell, \fBCopyGradientOfProperty_A_To_B()\fP will calculate the gradient of property 'a' for each cell and assign the result to the cell variable 'b'\&.
