.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class CELL> void \fBcsmp::ModelSubDomain\fP< dim, CELL >::InterpolateNodeToCellProperty (const char * nprop, const char * eprop)"
InterpolateNodePropertyToCellProperty() interpolates node property to the 'barycenter' of the triangle\&. The resulting value is different from the result obtained by applying the interrelation subclass NodeToCellProperty\&. The Calculate() method of the latter assigns the average value of the 3 cell nodes to the cell property 'eprop'\&.
